{"title": "Elixir of Vigilance", "pageid": 12947, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Elixir_of_Vigilance", "categories": ["Elixirs", "Uncommon items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ELX_Elixir_of_Vigilance_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/ELX_Elixir_of_Vigilance_Faded.png/300px-ELX_Elixir_of_Vigilance_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/f/f6/ELX_Elixir_of_Vigilance_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Elixir of Vigilance image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/ELX_Elixir_of_Vigilance_Faded.png/300px-ELX_Elixir_of_Vigilance_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/ELX_Elixir_of_Vigilance_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Elixir of Vigilance</span></a> is an elixir that when consumed, grants a +5 bonus to Initiative. In addition, you can't be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Surprised_(Condition)\" title=\"Surprised (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2c/Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2c/Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Surprised\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2c/Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Surprised_(Condition)\" title=\"Surprised (Condition)\">Surprised</a>. Replaces effects from other elixirs when drunk.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>An acrid, coppery aroma wafts from this liquid, clearing the senses and honing awareness.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixirs\" title=\"Elixirs\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/15px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/23px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/30px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elixirs\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/15px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"15\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixirs\" title=\"Elixirs\">Elixirs</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/38px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Single Use\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Single Use</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Uncommon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Uncommon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.4 kg (0.8 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\