3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hook\" title=\"Hook\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Hook_Item_Icon.png/20px-Hook_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Hook_Item_Icon.png/30px-Hook_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Hook_Item_Icon.png/40px-Hook_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Hook_Item_Icon.png/20px-Hook_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Hook_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hook\" title=\"Hook\">Hook</a>) and any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Ashes</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 136.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 134.66666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elixir_of_Vigilance_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"In-game model\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Elixir_of_Vigilance_Model.png/202px-Elixir_of_Vigilance_Model.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Elixir_of_Vigilance_Model.png/303px-Elixir_of_Vigilance_Model.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Elixir_of_Vigilance_Model.png/404px-Elixir_of_Vigilance_Model.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"In-game model\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Elixir_of_Vigilance_Model.png/202px-Elixir_of_Vigilance_Model.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"135\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Elixir_of_Vigilance_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">In-game model</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 